<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" modified="2026-08-18T03:10:32.000Z" agent="Hermes-AI" version="24.4.8" type="device">
  <diagram id="mining" name="The Sigma-Block Loop">
<mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="850" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1920" pageHeight="1400" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="draft" value="&#9888;&#65039; DRAFT &#8212; community draft — not verified, reviewed, or audited" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDECEA;strokeColor=#C62828;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#C62828;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="18" y="1356" width="380" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-t1" value="HOW DERO MINING WORKS — THE Σ-BLOCK LOOP" style="text;html=1;align=center;fontSize=30;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#4277BB;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="22" width="1880" height="42" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-t2" value="The network is the pool: every CPU miner earns — no pools, no ASICs, no trust.  (Σ-block = Sigma block = mini-block)" style="text;html=1;align=center;fontSize=14;fontColor=#5A6B7A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="66" width="1880" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-s0" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#1E88E5&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;1 · SET UP (5 minutes)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Run derod (the node) + the AstroBWTv3 miner on any CPU. Point&lt;br&gt;it at your wallet: --integrator-address / --wallet-address.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;💡 Mining is open to any PC — no ASICs, no GPUs, no pool.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#1E88E5;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=10;spacingTop=18;fontSize=11;fontColor=#22303C;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="150" width="400" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-bd0" value="1" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#1E88E5;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="43" y="133" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-s1" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#FB8C00&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;2 · SOLVE THE PUZZLE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;The miner races to find a Σ-block (mini-block) by solving a&lt;br&gt;memory-hard puzzle (≈256 MB per thread). Difficulty adjusts&lt;br&gt;every block to hold the 18 s pace.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;💡 A CPU lottery ticket every ~2 seconds.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FB8C00;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=10;spacingTop=18;fontSize=11;fontColor=#22303C;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="520" y="150" width="400" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-bd1" value="2" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#FB8C00;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="503" y="133" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-s2" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#FB8C00&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;3 · WIN A Σ-BLOCK (≈every 2 s)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Found one: your mini-block is gossiped to the network. 9&lt;br&gt;regular Σ-blocks + a 10th high-difficulty FINAL Σ-block close&lt;br&gt;the main block at 18 s.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;💡 Each Σ-block has a winner — up to 10 miners get paid per block.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#FB8C00;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=10;spacingTop=18;fontSize=11;fontColor=#22303C;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="150" width="400" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-bd2" value="3" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#FB8C00;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="963" y="133" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-s3" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#8E24AA&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;4 · THE NETWORK CHECKS (18 s block)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;The block is erasure-coded (48 chunks, any 16 rebuild it) and&lt;br&gt;every node re-validates. Rewards are split evenly among the&lt;br&gt;Σ-block winners + the block integrator.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;💡 Everyone double-checks the page before it is bound into the&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;💡 notebook.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8E24AA;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=10;spacingTop=18;fontSize=11;fontColor=#22303C;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="300" y="620" width="400" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-bd3" value="4" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#8E24AA;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="283" y="603" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-s4" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#2E7D32&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;5 · YOU GET PAID&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Your share of reward + fees lands in your encrypted balance.&lt;br&gt;Big miners win more often; small miners still earn daily. No&lt;br&gt;pool fees, no trust.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;💡 Rewards arrive automatically — the network IS the pool.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2E7D32;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacing=10;spacingTop=18;fontSize=11;fontColor=#22303C;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="760" y="620" width="400" height="330" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-bd4" value="5" style="ellipse;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;aspect=fixed;fillColor=#2E7D32;strokeColor=#FFFFFF;strokeWidth=2;fontColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="743" y="603" width="34" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-a1" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classicThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#0076BE;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=10.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0076BE;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="460" y="315" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="520" y="315" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="m-a2" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classicThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#0076BE;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=10.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0076BE;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="920" y="315" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="980" y="315" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="m-a3" value="the block settles" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classicThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#0076BE;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=10.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0076BE;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1380" y="340" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1380" y="600" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="m-a4" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classicThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#0076BE;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=10.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0076BE;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1380" y="600" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="500" y="600" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="m-a5" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classicThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#0076BE;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=10.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0076BE;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="500" y="650" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="500" y="620" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="m-a6" value="" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classicThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#0076BE;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=10.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0076BE;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="700" y="785" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="760" y="785" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="m-a7" value="reward + fees" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;html=1;endArrow=classicThin;endFill=1;strokeColor=#0076BE;strokeWidth=2.5;fontSize=10.5;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0076BE;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="1160" y="640" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="1160" y="1090" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="m-num" value="THE MATH OF Σ-BLOCKS" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#4277BB;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="150" width="300" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-n-~2 s" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4277BB&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;~2 s&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;  &lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;per Σ-block (mini-block) emission&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#22303C;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="180" width="430" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-n-18 s" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4277BB&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;18 s&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;  &lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;main block — settles 10 Σ-blocks&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#22303C;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="244" width="430" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-n-10" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4277BB&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;10&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;  &lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;Σ-blocks per block (9 + 1 final)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#22303C;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="308" width="430" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-n-~48,00" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4277BB&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;~48,000&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;  &lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;Σ-blocks per day (4,800 blocks × 10)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#22303C;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="372" width="430" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-n-88.4 /" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4277BB&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;88.4 / 10 / 1.6&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;  &lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;reward split — miners / integrator / your pool fee&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#22303C;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="436" width="430" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-n-≈256 M" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4277BB&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;≈256 MB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;  &lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;AstroBWTv3 memory per thread · CPU-only, ASIC/GPU resistant&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#22303C;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="500" width="430" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-n-every " value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4277BB&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;every block&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;  &lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;difficulty retarget — keeps the 18 s pace&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#22303C;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="564" width="430" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-n-every " value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4277BB&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;every ~4 years&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;  &lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;reward halving (7,000,000 blocks) · hard cap ≈20.89M&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11.5;fontColor=#22303C;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1440" y="628" width="430" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-f1" value="WHY IT MATTERS" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#4277BB;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1095" width="260" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="m-f2" value="Old mining: small miners earn nothing, pools take 2–5% and centralize power. DERO: your hashrate share of ~48,000 daily Σ-blocks pays you proportionally — solo, trustless, fair." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=13.5;fontColor=#22303C;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1120" width="1830" height="96" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
  <diagram id="mining-faq" name="Mining Key Numbers &amp; FAQ">
<mxGraphModel dx="1400" dy="850" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1920" pageHeight="736" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="draft" value="&#9888;&#65039; DRAFT &#8212; community draft — not verified, reviewed, or audited" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDECEA;strokeColor=#C62828;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#C62828;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="18" y="692" width="380" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-t" value="MINING — KEY NUMBERS &amp; FAQ" style="text;html=1;align=center;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#4277BB;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="22" width="1880" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-s" value="Print or share with a non-technical audience — the companion to ‘The Σ-Block Loop’." style="text;html=1;align=center;fontSize=13.5;fontColor=#5A6B7A;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="66" width="1880" height="22" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-h1" value="KEY NUMBERS" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#4277BB;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="115" width="400" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-h2" value="FREQUENTLY ASKED (PLAIN SPEAK)" style="text;html=1;align=left;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#4277BB;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="115" width="600" height="26" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-n0" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4277BB&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;~2 s&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;per Σ-block (mini-block) emission&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#22303C;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="150" width="880" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-n1" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4277BB&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;18 s&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;main block — settles 10 Σ-blocks&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#22303C;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="214" width="880" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-n2" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4277BB&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;10&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;Σ-blocks per block (9 + 1 final)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#22303C;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="278" width="880" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-n3" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4277BB&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;~48,000&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;Σ-blocks per day (4,800 blocks × 10)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#22303C;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="342" width="880" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-n4" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4277BB&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;88.4 / 10 / 1.6&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;reward split — miners / integrator / your pool fee&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#22303C;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="406" width="880" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-n5" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4277BB&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;≈256 MB&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;AstroBWTv3 memory per thread · CPU-only, ASIC/GPU resistant&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#22303C;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="470" width="880" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-n6" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4277BB&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;every block&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;difficulty retarget — keeps the 18 s pace&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#22303C;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="534" width="880" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-n7" value="&lt;font color=&quot;#4277BB&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;every ~4 years&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;reward halving (7,000,000 blocks) · hard cap ≈20.89M&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#4277BB;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#22303C;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="60" y="598" width="880" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-f0" value="&lt;b&gt;Do I need a mining pool?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;No — DERO’s Σ-block system makes the network the pool. Rewards are proportional to your hashrate share.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C9D6E3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#22303C;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="150" width="860" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-f1" value="&lt;b&gt;Can I mine on a laptop?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;Yes — AstroBWTv3 is CPU-only and memory-hard. You win less often than a big rig, but you still earn.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C9D6E3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#22303C;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="228" width="860" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-f2" value="&lt;b&gt;How much will I earn?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;Expected Σ-blocks/day = (your hashrate ÷ network hashrate) × 48,000. Check current hashrate in your daemon.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C9D6E3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#22303C;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="306" width="860" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-f3" value="&lt;b&gt;When do I get paid?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;Rewards are distributed every block (~18 s) to the Σ-block winners, proportional to their work.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C9D6E3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#22303C;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="384" width="860" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-f4" value="&lt;b&gt;What is the integrator bonus?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;Run a daemon with --integrator-address: you get 10% of every block you integrate + 1.6% if you run your own pool.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C9D6E3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#22303C;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="462" width="860" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-f5" value="&lt;b&gt;How do I start?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;Download derod + dero-miner from derod.org, sync the chain, set --integrator-address and --wallet-address, mine.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C9D6E3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#22303C;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="540" width="860" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="mq-f6" value="&lt;b&gt;What is crowd mining (EPOCH)?&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&quot;#66727E&quot;&gt;EPOCH lets apps turn user engagement into mining hashes submitted to a DERO node — developers get rewarded without ads or selling data (see DeroBeats).&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C9D6E3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#22303C;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="618" width="860" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
